SDK licensing scope
===================

APLUX proprietary implementation contributions are covered only to the extent
APLUX owns or may license them by LICENSES/Pandora-Model-SDK.zh-CN.txt and its
English translation LICENSES/Pandora-Model-SDK.en.txt. Third-party code retains
its applicable terms. The interface header and verifier are Apache-2.0.
Qualcomm Genie and tokenizer components are linked into libhy_mt2.so; their
supplier and open-source terms are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt and LICENSES/.
Unchanged Qualcomm QNN user-space runtime libraries are included in qnn248/;
retain qnn248/LICENSE.pdf, qnn248/NOTICE.txt and qnn248/QNN_NOTICE.txt with them.
Device BSP/drivers, AidLMS, FastRPC, DSP firmware and basic system libraries remain
external device prerequisites. Model weights and tokenizer data are distributed
separately. These external components retain their own terms.
Keep these notices and accompanying full license texts with this SDK payload.
